meta {
  name: getProductGroups
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getProductGroups",
    "params": {
      "product_group_type": [
        "ALLOWANCE"
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve product groups

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |
  | `product_group_id` | integer[] (nullable) | no | Filter by internal product group IDs |
  | `product_group_type` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by group type: ALLOWANCE, BUYING, or CUSTOM |
  | `product_group_code` | string[] (nullable) | no | Filter by product group codes |

  **Example: Allowance groups**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getProductGroups",
    "params": {
      "product_group_type": [
        "ALLOWANCE"
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_groups": [
      {
        "product_group_id": 1,
        "product_group_type": "ALLOWANCE",
        "product_group_code": "001",
        "product_group_name": "Kabelbinders",
        "product_group_comment": ""
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 1000,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
